        "rulings": [
            {
                "date": "2023-02-04",
                "text": "A player is poisoned if that player has one or more poison counters."
            },
            {
                "date": "2023-02-04",
                "text": "A player with ten or more poison counters loses the game. This is a state-based action and doesn't use the stack. In other words, it happens immediately and players can't respond to it, just like a player losing the game due to having 0 or less life."
